      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — removing unused helpers, constants, and imports; grouping assertions by scenario; and using inline comments to clarify intent.The improved test compiles successfully. The refactored version removes the six unused helper methods and constants, drops the seven unnecessary imports, and adds brief inline comments that group the three scenarios (normal input, empty string, null string) so the test's intent is immediately clear."
